issue_context.body:
### Description

For accessibility, the ability to use the keyboard is useful. Pan left/right etc is built-in, but not zoom in/out. Suggest using keyboard + and - for zoom in/out.

### Solution

Add keycodes PLUS: 107, MINUS: 109 to this.keys.
In function handleKeyDown, add extra case clauses 
                       case scope.keys.PLUS:
                                dollyOut( getZoomScale() );
                                scope.update();
                                break;
                        case scope.keys.MINUS:
                                dollyIn( getZoomScale() );
                                scope.update();
                                break;
works for me locally :)


### Alternatives

Not aware of any.

